s feature fixed, even folds at the top for an elegant, layered look. Easily opened and closed with hooks or rings, they’re ideal for formal, sophisticated spaces where curtains are frequently adjusted.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_eKiqHN","text_VRbrax"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pleat.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":780,"image_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/pleated-drapery","full_width":true,"text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":true,"overlay_style":"box"}},"custom_content_qM3HjE":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_9D6yJ8":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Pinch_Pleat_2_3.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_hWjgEX":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pleats are stitched at the center to create a symmetrical, compact design. This style enhances the curtain’s dimension and texture, adding a refined and elegant appearance.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Specifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pleats<strong>:<\/strong> spacing 4 3\/4 – 5 1\/2 inches; pleat depth approx. 1 3\/16 inches; standard fullness ratio 2.2×-2.5x.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Additional Information:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Includes complimentary adjustable white hooks and black Roman rings.<\/li><li>Compatible with both rods and tracks (sold separately).<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_9D6yJ8","text_hWjgEX"],"settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":false,"full_width":fa