ong><\/p><ul><li>The pleats are <strong>stitched slightly below the top edge<\/strong>, offering a refined silhouette with graceful fabric folds.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Specifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pleats<strong>:<\/strong> spacing 4 3\/4 – 5 1\/2 inches; pleat depth approx. 1 3\/16 inches; standard fullness ratio 2.2×-2.5x.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Additional Information:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Includes complimentary adjustable white hooks and black Roman rings.<\/li><li>Suitable for both rods and tracks (sold separately).<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_RkMEYq","text_VXK9Uk"],"settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"custom_content_cD7cze":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_JB7cjc":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Goblet_3d41c876-5444-46f4-b601-227c521dd307.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_Eq9eUh":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Goblet pleats have a wide, rounded top, resembling an inverted goblet. Their decorative, elegant style is ideal for European or luxury decor themes.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Specifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pleat spacing: 5 1\/8 — 5 1\/2 inches; Depth: approx. 3 15\/16 inches; Standard fullness ratio is 2.2x.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Additional Information:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Includes free adjustable white hooks and black Roman rings.<\/li><li>Compatible with rods and tracks (sold separately).<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_JB7cjc","text_Eq9eUh"],"settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"rich_text_6UxRmC":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_t9nCPb":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Understanding Pleated Header Styles","use_h1":false}}},"block_order":["heading_t9nCPb"],"custom_css":["@media (min-width: 1024px) {.fully-spaced-row--medium {margin-bottom: -75px; }}","@media (max-width: 767px) {.fully-spaced-row--medium {margin-bottom: -50px; }}"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"height":"medium","text_alignment":"center","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"default"}},"custom_content_6iD8U7":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_Bdw7zn":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/difference_b1f69928-aacb-4c22-b1f6-1e6c54bb1fa7.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_FpB8qG":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<ul><li><strong>Tailor Pleat<\/strong><br\/>Stitched <strong>at the top<\/strong> with a wider opening below. <br\/>Offers a crisp, elongated look—clean, modern, and visually lifted.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Pinch Pleat<\/strong><br\/>Stitched <strong>at the center<\/strong> of each pleat, creating a tighter, more structured look. <br\/>Classic, symmetrical, and formal with strong definition.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>French Pleat<\/strong><br\/>Stitched <strong>at the bottom<\/strong>, allowing the top to fan open like an elegant bloom. <br\/>Softer, more decorative, and ideal for adding graceful dimension.<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_Bdw7zn","text_FpB8qG"],"name":"Custom content","settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"image_with_text_overlay_CfPQTF":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"subheading_LKQjmz":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":""}},"heading_t8xxQX":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Ripple Fold","heading_max_width":15,"title_size":50,"title_size_mobile":26,"use_h1":false}},"text_mqbUhx":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ripple fold curtains create smooth, evenly spaced waves for a sleek, modern look and effortless glide.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["subheading_LKQjmz","heading_t8xxQX","text_mqbUhx"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ripple_fold_banner2.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":780,"image_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/ripple-fold-drapery","full_width":true,"text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":true,"overlay_style":"box"}},"custom_content_7KkzFE":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_CF64LN":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RippleFold_31fef4d6-ddce-4f89-96f7-a73e8173c5d4.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_BLYRfi":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<p>Overview:<\/p><ul><li>Ripple Fold curtains form smooth, evenly spaced waves that glide effortlessly along the track, offering a sleek, modern look that enhances the fabric’s natural drape.<\/li><\/ul><p>Specifications:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Runner Length<\/strong>: 1 1\/8\" — vertical length of each hook (top to bottom).<\/li><li><strong>Runner Spacing<\/strong>: 4 3\/8\" — distance between one hook and the next (center to center).<\/li><li><strong>Track to Carrier Drop<\/strong>: 1 3\/8\" — vertical distance from the top of the track to the bottom of the carrier (roller hook).<\/li><\/ul><p>Additional Information:<\/p><ul><li>Includes adjustable hooks for easy installation.<\/li><li>Suitable for traverse rods with ripple fold gliders and ripple fold tracks.<\/li><li>Standard fullness ratio: 2.2x.<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_CF64LN","text_BLYRfi"],"settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"image_with_text_overlay_YJHzn4":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"subheading_LixnGX":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":""}},"heading_EgMtfE":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Grommet","heading_max_width":15,"title_size":50,"title_size_mobile":26,"use_h1":false}},"text_dq8EmR":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Grommet curtains feature metal rings at the top for a natural, elegant drape. The rings ensure easy installation and reduce friction, enhancing durability.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["subheading_LixnGX","heading_EgMtfE","text_dq8EmR"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/grommet_3710fe79-306c-4e45-be1e-96a449d3af55.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":780,"image_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/grommet-drapery","full_width":true,"text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":true,"overlay_style":"box"}},"custom_content_fRt4Aa":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_jEAyKR":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Grommet_56071a8d-5d3e-4b39-85ca-f9fff62427db.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_BdADgp":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<p><strong>Specifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Grommet size: Inner diameter: 1 5\/8 inches; Outer diameter: 2 13\/16 inches; Ring width: 9\/16 inches.<\/li><li>Side hem: 1 3\/16 inches; Bottom hem: 3 5\/32 inches.<\/li><li>Recommendation: Use an even number of grommets for balanced folds.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Additional Information:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Designed for curtain rods; available in our Accessories section.<\/li><li>Not compatible with curtain tracks; no hooks or rings needed.<\/li><li>Standard fullness ratio: 2.2x.<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_jEAyKR","text_BdADgp"],"settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"image_with_text_overlay_fQpiCc":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"heading_cmFakr":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Soft Top","heading_max_width":15,"title_size":50,"title_size_mobile":26,"use_h1":false}},"text_CcwAqC":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>With no grommets, hooks, or structured pleats, Soft Top curtains offer a natural, relaxed drape. Their smooth, gentle waves are perfect for creating a casual, modern look.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_cmFakr","text_CcwAqC"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/soft_top.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":780,"image_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/soft-top-drapery","full_width":true,"text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":true,"overlay_style":"box"}},"custom_content_pP9HAY":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_wbkRJd":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RodPocket_fee6ec1b-f5ac-45ed-a480-e3933388cba8.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_rNhcgN":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","t